        "id": 2046576
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-03-20T12:18:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Updated fuzzer to use `consumeBytes()` and send the data buffer for `init()`. Since passing whole data buffer will consume all FDP, kept a limit of `0.8*size` for `consumeBytes()`.",
      "parentUuid": "c0d6f1d1_1b07b0a9",
      "revId": "ad846f699abb124307924eab752c832403669d17",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
